1475 0 obj
<<
/Title (Despite the growing influence of LLM systems, many existing evaluation methods rely on testing conditions that include authenticated or signed-in sessions. Because logged-in environments may introduce personalization or account-based context, retrieval behavior observed in these conditions may differ from results produced in neutral, non-authenticated environments. )
/Dest [16 0 R /XYZ 72.398438 267.79102 0]
/Parent 5 0 R
/SE 323 0 R
/Prev 1473 0 R
/Next 1477 0 R
>>
endobj
