>>
endobj
1477 0 obj
<<
/Title (This paper introduces the GEO Non-Biased Audit, a Human-in-the-Loop \(HITL\) framework designed to evaluate cross-platform AI retrieval behavior under non-authenticated conditions intended to minimize personalization effects. The framework proposes a reproducible methodology for measuring how AI systems interpret publicly available identity information across multiple platforms. )
/Dest [16 0 R /XYZ 72.111328 176.45361 0]
/Parent 5 0 R
/SE 324 0 R
/Prev 1475 0 R
/Next 1479 0 R
>>
endobj
1478 0 obj
