/Parent 5 0 R
/SE 696 0 R
/Prev 1480 0 R
/Next 1476 0 R
>>
endobj
1479 0 obj
<<
/Title (The evaluation framework incorporates standardized prompting protocols, including the use of one-shot prompting techniques, to reduce variability in model interpretation. By controlling prompt structure and maintaining consistent testing environments, the framework aims to improve the reliability of cross-platform comparisons. )
/Dest [17 0 R /XYZ 72.111328 717.48047 0]
/Parent 5 0 R
/SE 325 0 R
/Prev 1477 0 R
/Next 1481 0 R
>>
endobj
