1481 0 obj
<<
/Title (Evidence-based audits conducted across 10 AI platforms demonstrate consistent information retrieval patterns when evaluated under a standardized, non-biased protocol. These findings highlight the importance of standardized evaluation methods for understanding how AI systems influence identity discoverability and informational visibility in digital environments. )
/Dest [17 0 R /XYZ 72.111328 642.00586 0]
/Parent 5 0 R
/SE 326 0 R
/Prev 1479 0 R
/Next 1483 0 R
